  "body": "Add the core safety primitives for the in-app AI chat panel.\n\n## Scope\n- Add a labelled `BatchCommand` group (`begin_group` and `commit_group`) to `History` in `crates/app/src/commands/mod.rs`. One chat turn becomes one undo step on `Ctrl+Z`.\n- Add a read-only `get_selection` MCP tool in `crates/app/src/mcp/`. This tool reads active geometry picks (`state.op_ui.geo` and `state.geo_pick` in `crates/ui/src/state.rs`) and selected entities (`crates/app/src/commands/select_entity.rs`).\n- Add a live permission gate in front of `camcraft_app::mcp::answer_live` (`crates/app/src/mcp/live.rs`). Require explicit user approval before CamCraft runs `post`, writes files (`save_project`, `export_tool_library`), accesses file-path arguments, or changes machine/post/workholding limits (`load_machine`, `edit_machine`, `set_setup_post`, `set_workholding_max_rpm`, `set_setup_nose_to_axis`).\n- Never auto-approve G-code posting or machine edits.\n- Keep all dependencies in the `ui -> app` direction (`AGENTS.md`).\n\nDone means: One `Ctrl+Z` action reverts a multi-call test turn, `get_selection` returns selected picks in tests, and the permission gate blocks unconfirmed posting, file writes, and machine edits until the user approves them.\n\nPart of #1773\n",
